     "explanation": "**Subtract.**",
     "latex": "\\operatorname{Var}(X)=\\frac{99}8-\\frac9{64}=\\frac{783}{64}\\approx12.234"
    },
    {
     "explanation": "**Root.**",
     "latex": "\\sigma_X\\approx3.498"
    }
   ],
